      "content": "Wait, you said 'targeted code changes' can fix it? I thought the legacy auth system was pretty foundational to their setup. Are you sure it's just a patch job? I don't want to go to the board and tell them everything is fine only for them to find out later that the whole system needs to be ripped out and replaced. It's a massive budget hit if we're wrong.",
